  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AlrauneWonTalking.TakeBackWhatSaid": "[pg][say: I take back what I said, I <b>do</b> respect you. It takes a bold amount of stupidity to act smarmy in your position.]"
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AlrauneWonWake.WakeGlancingDeliriously": "You wake up, glancing around deliriously for a moment until your senses can right themselves. Judging from the sky above, it must have been nearly 8 hours. You don't see the alraune, so you carefully gather your things before that changes."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskAlraune.BecomeAKin": "[pg][say: You'll become as much a kin of mine as you can be. Accept your place as part of the natural world. Your body is stronger this way.]"
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskAlraune.EscapeIsntNecessary": "Escape isn't necessary--you have reason to confront this creature. Arms raised aside, you gesture to your vine-clad {0}form. It was one of [i:her] kind that afflicted you with this curse, and you need answers. To this, the alraune giggles. [say: It's beautiful, isn't it?] She sighs contently before assuring you that it's no curse. [say: No harm will befall you by those vines. They are an extension of you now, thriving only while you yourself do.]"
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskAlraune.ForcedToFeedParasite": "[pg]Being forced to feed this parasite, whether it will kill you or not, is hardly acceptable. Though, the assurance your life will remain intact is at least somewhat comforting, if nothing else. You probe the plant-woman for more information."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskAlrauneAnswer.SighingLeansForward": "[pg]Sighing, she leans forward on her floral mound. [say: Now whether you like it or not, I'm interested in enjoying myself. Lay down and take it.]"
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskAlrauneAnswer.ThatsAllYoullBe": "[pg]That's all you'll be needing for now, with little else you wish to investigate at this time. However, when you turn away, one of the alraune's vines rustles the grass and leaves near your [feet]. [say:Information isn't free, you know,] she says threateningly."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskAlrauneAnswer.VinesExorcised": "These vines must be exorcised. The plant-woman laughs. [say: They're a part of you! I am no more capable of removing those vines than I am removing one of your limbs. The roots have taken hold in your flesh, and flesh is not so fluid as to just come apart on a whim.]"
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskAmily.AfterAllThatTime": "After all that time away from civilization, Amily may have picked up a lot of useful information about plants. That in mind, you explain your situation to her."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskAmily.AmilyFarFromConfident": "[pg]Amily sounds far from confident in that. Sighing, you thank her for the input."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskAmily.IfOnlySomething": "[pg]If only there was something that could just make these vines slip right off..."
