  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskHolliRemove.DryadGrinsAsBegins": "[pg]The dryad grins as she begins listing off, [say: Three bottle of pure honey, three bottles of milk--I won't be picky what it's from--five vials of snake oil, and five slimy cloths.]"
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskHolliRemove.FoldsArmsAndSays": "[pg]Holli folds her arms and says with a defensive tone, [say: This is what I need before getting those vines off of you.]"
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskHolliRemove.NoFunAtAll": "[pg][say: Hmph! No fun at all. {0} I will need you to bring me some things.]"
