  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskHolliRemove.SaysSheepishly": "[pg][say: R-right,] she says, sheepishly. [say: All you'll need is a slimy cloth.]"
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskHolliRemove.SheMopes": "[pg][say: Aw, I looked forward to seeing you in this form more,] she mopes. [say: I shall help, but I hope you'll visit me for sex more often for this!]"
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskHolliRemove.ShellHaveToWait": "[pg]She'll just have to wait and see, your time is your own. Right now, she needs to fix your vine problem, or else."
