  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskHolliRemove.VeryWellYouKnow": "[pg]Very well, you know what to do and you shall set off to do it."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskJojo.AdmitsSaddened": "[pg][say: I really don't know what's going on here, [name],] he admits, saddened at his lack of helpfulness. [say: I suggest we meditate on it, and pray that the solution finds us.]"
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskJojo.ComplyPresentingArm": "[pg]You comply, presenting your arm. He seems more comfortable studying the vines in detail while they're not framing the view of your [genitals]."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskJojo.IfOnlySomething": "[pg]If only there was something that could just make these vines slip right off..."
