  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskJojo.PiousAndPureMonk": "Might a pious and pure monk by chance know any such remedy for this corruption that plagues your flesh? It's starting to chafe."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskKiha.AfterSoMuchTime": "After having spent so much time living in the swamp, perhaps Kiha knows a few things about the black velvet alraune. You go over the gist of what transpired and how your new outfit is fused to your flesh."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskKiha.SheSaysFirmly": "[pg][say: Burn them,] she says, firmly."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskKihaAnswer.BlushesLooksAway": "[pg]Kiha blushes and looks away awkwardly, aware that she didn't help at all. [say: D-doofus.]"
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskKihaAnswer.ExclaimsGenuineFear": "[pg][say: I-I'm sorry, I thought that'd work!] she exclaims in genuine fear she hurt you. You assure her, however, that you're okay. Somehow you only feel winded from it. She was only doing what she thought would help, and you thank her for caring."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskKihaAnswer.FlameRetardantVines": "[pg]Flame-retardant vines aside, you'd have thought she'd be familiar with alraune. Somehow, she's completely oblivious to their existence."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskKihaAnswer.IfOnlySomething": "[pg]If only there was something that could just make these vines slip right off..."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskKihaAnswer.InhalesDeeplyThen": "Kiha inhales deeply, then follows with blowing an intense stream of fire directly on your body. It causes burns and aches all over, and the vines seem to constrict and drain you to resist the heat. In moments, you've fallen to the ground in exhaustion."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskKihaAnswer.RaiseArmsDefensively": "You raise your arms defensively and urge the pseudo-dragon to not flame-broil your face.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskKihaAnswer.VeryLikelyExplanation": "[pg]That's a very likely explanation. Alraune are mostly-stationary plants, and Kiha is a ferocious fire-breathing dragon-woman that is quickly angered by just about anybody but you. Thinking over it again, you'd be more surprised if an alraune <i>did</i> reveal herself to Kiha."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskKihaAnswer.WhyYouNeedMe": "[pg][say: This is why you need me around more to protect you! Those alraune were probably always too scared of me to show their no-good faces!]"
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskKitsune.MedicalConjuresThoughts": "[pg]'Medical' tends to conjure thoughts of diseases and infections. You aren't going to die, are you?"
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskKitsune.PutsHandUpTo": "[pg]She puts a hand up to gesture that you should stay calm. [say: No, no, nothing like that! You'll be okay, I think.]"
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskKitsune.QuestionsBewildered": "[pg][say: You're asking me for medical advice?] she questions, bewildered."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskKitsune.RemoveThemThen": "[pg][say: Look, I'll remove them then! Will you come home with me if I do that?]"
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskKitsune.TemptingThoughItMight": "Tempting though it might be to tag along for whatever she may have in store, you're actually hoping the magical forest-dwelling kitsune knows a thing or two about the ominous vines attached to you."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskKitsune.ThinkMatterOf": "[pg]Think? This is a matter of your health! {0} if you die!"
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskKitsuneNo.DiscoverYourself": "[pg]That will be for you to discover for yourself, you decide as you turn and walk off into the woods."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskKitsuneNo.IfOnlySomething": "[pg]If only there was something that could just make these vines slip right off..."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskKitsuneNo.KitsuneSighs": "[pg]The kitsune sighs, bringing a hand to her face. [say: It's probably nothing, and you worry too much.]"
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskKitsuneNo.SheHardlyKnows": "She hardly sounds like she knows what she's talking about! Maybe asking illusory magicians deep in the woods isn't the best idea."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskKitsuneYes.EitherItWorks": "Either it works and your problem is solved, or it doesn't and you don't have to follow the lecherous fox. This is a perfectly reasonable agreement."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskKitsuneYes.IfOnlySomething": "[pg]If only there was something that could just make these vines slip right off..."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskKitsuneYes.KitsuneWalksUpClose": "[pg]The kitsune walks up close to you, clasping her hands on the smoothest portion of vine that she can. She closes her eyes, taking a deep breath. [say: Last time I encountered something similar to this, my sisters and I developed a very fast solution. It might sting a little.]"
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskKitsuneYes.NoFurtherFanfare": "[pg]With no further fanfare, the kitsune yanks the vine with all of her might. You hold yourself as steady as you can, but the vine doesn't budge. She yanks again."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskKitsuneYes.SaysWipingBrow": "[pg][say: That's all my strategies exhausted,] she says while wiping her brow. [say: Want to unwind from all that stress with my sisters and I?]"
