  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskKitsuneYes.YetAgainSheYanks": "[pg]Yet again, she yanks."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskRathazul.AfterMoreSilentReading": "[pg]After more silent reading and flipping of pages, Rathazul sighs. [say: I do not know what to do about this,] he confesses. Seeing the reaction on your face, he speaks further. [say: From what I gather is that it probably will not kill you. It is acting as a parasite, and one that will not want the death of its host.] Not dying isn't good enough, you still need an answer. [say:I will continue learning what I can. Perhaps, with time, I can find a solution. Should you still need it, I will provide my findings post-haste.]"
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskRathazul.ExplainingTheSituation": "[pg]Explaining the situation, you tell Rathazul about the black velvet alraune and the inner portion of root that adhered itself to your body. Aside from the occasional pain, it also forces you to prance nude around him and everybody else.{0}"
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskRathazul.IfOnlySomething": "[pg]If only there was something that could just make these vines slip right off..."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskRathazul.OldRatHuffs": "[pg]The old rat huffs as he mulls over the correct approach to this dilemma, soon deciding to rifle through some notebook he has. Watching from over his shoulder, you see many sketches of plants and small scribblings of text. The alchemist, noticing your curiosity, speaks as he reads. [say: Any practicing alchemist would have notes about all they can gather on the local vegetation. As it happens, I also have notes on alraune, but they are largely second-hand.]"
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskRathazul.PresentVineWrappedArm": "You present your vine-wrapped arm to the rat, plainly requesting he work his magic."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskRathazul.StaresForAMoment": "[pg]Rathazul stares for a moment before looking you in the eye. [say: You do know this is science, not magic?] [if (silly) {He doesn't seem pleased to be an ex machina|He seems to know what you meant, but would prefer a more respectful approach}]."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskShouldra.ActuallySoundLogic": "[pg]That's actually sound logic. You'd commend her strategy if not for the sharp and horrible pain running through you. As you grow particularly large, the vines choke your body and drain all they can to keep up."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskShouldra.BeforeYouCanReact": "[pg]Before you can react to her, she dashes back into your being, resting after using such high-speed growth and shrinking in quick succession."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskShouldra.EyesGlimmeringWithGold": "[pg][say: Hoh yeah, I know what to do,] she says, eyes glimmering with gold. Your body trembles and shakes, soon increasing in size. To your dismay, Shouldra appears to have been thinking of something else. Contrary to your assumption, however, she shakes her head and elaborates, [say: Those vines will have to snap if you get too big too quickly!]"
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskShouldra.IfOnlySomething": "[pg]If only there was something that could just make these vines slip right off..."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskShouldra.SavesOnTheExplanation": "[pg]That saves on the explanation, but does she know how to help?"
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskShouldra.VinesFollowedSuit": "[pg]The vines followed suit. You are not cured of the dilemma, and now you're even more sore. Shouldra laughs awkwardly as her plot falls flat. [say: On the bright side, at least the outfit is cool.]"
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskShouldra.WraithMaterializes": "The wraith materializes in front of you without hesitation. [say: I know exactly what you're thinking, Champ!]"
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.AskShouldra.YellsTheGhost": "[pg][say: Wait, wait, I've got this!] yells the ghost, doing little to quell your doubts. As her eyes glow brighter, you suddenly shrink very quickly. In moments, you've fallen to the size of an infant."
