  "Scenes.Alraunescene.HolliSolutionRub.SurprisinglySimpleSolution": "[pg]Surprisingly simple solution."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.HolliSolutionRub.TryToVoiceIssue": "[pg]You try to voice this issue, but as you begin, the vines tremble and shake. The constricting tendrils which once plagued you all slip down your glistening body with ease. The organic outfit, now lacking a host, shrivels and dies at your [feet]."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.HolliSolutionRub.WentThroughAllTrouble": "You went through all the trouble of getting it, she should go through all the trouble of applying it."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.RatClue.ExplainsUsheringOver": "[pg][say: I believe I have found the remedy you were seeking, [name],] he explains, ushering you over to his living space. [say: To survive, these vines must have something they are capable of attaching to.]"
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.RatClue.SoundLogicEvidently": "[pg]Sound logic. Evidently your [skinshort] [skinis] on that list of things it can attach to, so you'd like him to get to the point."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.RatClue.StatesFlipsThroughSome": "[pg][say: Slime,] Rathazul states, [say: you may be able to remove the vines safely if you have some way to reduce the consistency of your body to slime.] He flips through some recent writing he's compiled on the matter. [say: It may not be a full transformation, just reaching the point that you sweat such ooze may be sufficient, however I have not done any trials to be sure.]"
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.RatClue.StrollThroughCamp": "As you stroll through camp, the old alchemist calls you over."
  "Scenes.Alraunescene.RatClue.WorstCaseScenario": "[pg]Worst case scenario, your new problem will be turning your goo body back to flesh, which is not too daunting of a task in this world. That just leaves finding a way to gooify yourself; you might have an idea in mind."
}
